{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And he offered it</b> — twice in the Masorah: here and the other: \"and she made it for the man who came to her\" — in the matter of David, regarding the poor man who had nothing but a single lamb. Meaning: \"and he offered it according to the ordinance\" — he himself rendered the judgment, and \"the lamb he shall restore fourfold.\""], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:29.219858363Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}